{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17571","headline":"礼部试早春残雪 · 姚康","name":"礼部试早春残雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微暖春潜至，轻明雪尚残。\n银铺光渐湿，珪破色仍寒。\n无柳花常在，非秋露正团。\n素光浮转薄，皓质驻应难。\n幸得依阴处，偏宜带月看。\n玉尘销欲尽，穷巷起袁安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚康","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}